{"4891130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "雨梦江湖", "steam_appid": 4891130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >致敬英雄坛说，重新设计了游戏内容。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这是一款复古像素武侠GMUD游戏，开放世界，自由探索。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >按键</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >方向键↑↓←→控制人物移动、游戏选项，Enter键交互、确认，Esc键游戏菜单、关闭、取消，空格键轻功传送。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >探索</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索地图上的人和物，获取信息、了解背景、交换隐藏物品、做任务。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >门派</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6个各具特色的门派：三清宫、万佛寺、天策府、文衡院、血煞门、凝霜剑派，每个门派有自己的武功体系、招式、绝招。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >秘术</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >寻找不同的NPC学习秘术，提升属性或解锁功能。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >异宝</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >获取不同作用的异宝，每一件都可以提升游戏体验。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >技艺</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >烹饪、炼药、炼丹、钓鱼</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >装备</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >数值浮动、随机获得次级词条、可强化</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >战斗</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >回合制战斗，和NPC一决高下，获取掉落的装备和物品。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >更多游戏内容等你发现...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >致敬英雄坛说，重新设计了游戏内容。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这是一款复古像素武侠GMUD游戏，开放世界，自由探索。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >按键</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >方向键↑↓←→控制人物移动、游戏选项，Enter键交互、确认，Esc键游戏菜单、关闭、取消，空格键轻功传送。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >探索</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索地图上的人和物，获取信息、了解背景、交换隐藏物品、做任务。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >门派</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6个各具特色的门派：三清宫、万佛寺、天策府、文衡院、血煞门、凝霜剑派，每个门派有自己的武功体系、招式、绝招。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >秘术</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >寻找不同的NPC学习秘术，提升属性或解锁功能。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >异宝</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >获取不同作用的异宝，每一件都可以提升游戏体验。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >技艺</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >烹饪、炼药、炼丹、钓鱼</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >装备</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >数值浮动、随机获得次级词条、可强化</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >战斗</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >回合制战斗，和NPC一决高下，获取掉落的装备和物品。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >更多游戏内容等你发现...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "一个安静的夜晚，窗外飘来阵阵雨声，你在电脑前玩着你最喜欢的游戏，不知过了多久你有点困了便趴着睡着了，梦里你来到一个既熟悉又陌生的地方，一个江湖的故事就此拉开序幕...", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891130/212cb603c893e4375fa40f5f909d8308f47cf221/header.jpg?t=1788192314", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891130/ce43ca8a7b54e1b0fcd3d382379ec1893b877d97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788192314", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891130/ce43ca8a7b54e1b0fcd3d382379ec1893b877d97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788192314", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["作者分身"], "publishers": ["作者分身"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 499, "final": 499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$4.99"}, "packages": [1698073], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy 雨梦江湖", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1698073, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "雨梦江湖 - $4.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 499}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "p